1
00:00:00,945 --> 00:00:05,195
(Sheldon:)-Butterscotch scone?
-Thanks.

2
00:00:06,617 --> 00:00:08,957
(Leonard:)-It's good.
-What you're tasting is respect...

3
00:00:09,120 --> 00:00:10,410
(Sheldon:)...and affection.

4
00:00:11,956 --> 00:00:13,996
(Sheldon:)And about a pound of Crisco.

5
00:00:15,126 --> 00:00:17,836
After breakfast,
I thought we could spend the day...

6
00:00:18,003 --> 00:00:21,633
(Sheldon:)...watching the final season of Babylon 5
with director commentary.

7
00:00:21,799 --> 00:00:23,299
(Leonard:)You hate Babylon 5.

8
00:00:23,467 --> 00:00:27,677
(Sheldon:)I do. It fails as drama, science fiction
and it's hopelessly derivative.

9
00:00:27,847 --> 00:00:30,637
(Sheldon:)But you like it, and you're my friend.

10
00:00:31,642 --> 00:00:32,812
(Leonard:)Okay, great.

11
00:00:35,062 --> 00:00:38,652
(Leonard:)-Still not taking you to Switzerland.
-Drat.

12
00:00:42,528 --> 00:00:44,568
(Sheldon:)No Frodo for you.

13
00:00:48,659 --> 00:00:50,659
SHELDON: Hello.
-Hello.

14
00:00:50,828 --> 00:00:52,868
(Sheldon:)Let's dispense
with the friendly banter.

15
00:00:54,331 --> 00:00:55,751
(Sheldon:)I believe you know why I'm here.

16
00:00:56,167 --> 00:00:58,337
(Penny:)Well, I always figured
it was to study us...

17
00:00:58,502 --> 00:01:03,022
(Penny:)...discover our weaknesses,
and report back to your alien overlords.

